==Faroese==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|fo}} {{term|rot|rót|root|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|fo}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*wrōts}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|fo}} {{term/t|ine-pro|*wrd-||root}}; compare with English {{term|wort|lang=en}} and the Latin {{term/t|la|rādīx||root}}. Cognate with the Icelandic {{term|rót|lang=is}}; Old English {{term/t|ang|rōt}} (whence the Middle English word {{term|root||the underground part of a plant}} came, whence the English {{term|root|lang=en}} came).

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ɹɔuːt]|lang=fo}}

===Noun===
{{fo-noun|f|rótar|røtur}}

# [[root]]

